<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Costello says low rain a risk for farm output.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Costello says low rain a risk for farm output.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello said on Thursday low rainfall was a risk for Australian farm output forecasts and data in the next few weeks would show how much output would be affected.</p>
</text>
